      "text": "📈 Error Trends & Anomaly Distribution (Last 24 Hours):\n\n[Time Series Trend Visualizer]\n• 00:00 - 06:00 ─── Normal Baseline (12 anomalies/hr)\n• 06:00 - 12:00 ─────── GSM Basement Blackout Spike (145 anomalies/hr @\nVincom Landmark 81)\n• 12:00 - 18:00 ───── Charger Overheat Spike (88 anomalies/hr @ 85.5°C\nThermal Fault)\n• 18:00 - 24:00 ──── CAN-Bus Overvoltage Telemetry Spike (32 anomalies/hr\n@ 9999V)\n\nSeverity Breakdown: 🔴 Critical: 18%  |  🟡 Warning: 62%  |  🔵 Info: 20%",
