      "text": "🩺 Multi-Agent Anomaly Detector & Diagnosis Status (dbt Lineage Graph):\n\nDetector Engine: Dual Composite Score (Robust MAD Z-Score + Isolation\nForest ML)\n\nTop Diagnosed Root Causes:\n1. GSM Cellular Signal Drop in Underground Basements (45% of total faults)\n   Root Cause: Vehicles entering underground parking areas lose GPS/cellular\nconnectivity.\n2. V-GREEN Fast Charger Thermal Throttling @ 85.5°C (30% of total\nfaults)\n   Root Cause: Ambient temperature combined with high-current charging\ntriggers safety cutoff.\n3. Teen-code NLP Ambiguity in Customer App Reviews (25% of total faults)\n   Root Cause: Colloquial Vietnamese slang requires custom entity normalizer\ndictionary.",
      "originalText": "🩺 Multi-Agent Anomaly Detector & Diagnosis Status (dbt Lineage Graph):\n\nDetector Engine: Dual Composite Score (Robust MAD Z-Score + Isolation Forest ML)\n\nTop Diagnosed Root Causes:\n1. GSM Cellular Signal Drop in Underground Basements (45% of total faults)\n   Root Cause: Vehicles entering underground parking areas lose GPS/cellular connectivity.\n2. V-GREEN Fast Charger Thermal Throttling @ 85.5°C (30% of total faults)\n   Root Cause: Ambient temperature combined with high-current charging triggers safety cutoff.\n3. Teen-code NLP Ambiguity in Customer App Reviews (25% of total faults)\n   Root Cause: Colloquial Vietnamese slang requires custom entity normalizer dictionary.",
